  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d8e38e7a-6260-44f6-adca-9fb32109133d"],
 " under the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Method"]], "paclet:ref/Method"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "827c88a1-c712-44b7-b62a-5fe3bd76fff3"],
 ". With the default ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2a51ae2d-d5c8-4256-97e2-1a7e205322d8"],
 " it is the least number of balls of radius ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 " that cover: the size of a smallest ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 "-dominating set, which graph theory calls the ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 "-domination number of ",
 StyleBox["g", "TI"],
 ", the domination number at ",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 " = 1. The radius defaults to 1 and the targets to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["All"]], "paclet:ref/All"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "92b326be-87d9-4a93-aabd-38f61f3329d9"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"47acf83f-44c6-4aa2-820a-350c5027b7a4"],

